    "detailed_description": "Hellventure is a brand-new first-person escape horror game that combines rogue-lite elements.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/37ae2ef3d2878bcab203c6384bb42f8d.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div><br>You are in a computer-generated dark dungeon.<br>Open the coffin in the room, you may get the treasures, you may find the exit, and you may release scary monsters.<br><br>Will you be trapped forever, or escape from here?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/d713cc33e156257bacd9a4b84b6f8072.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open the coffins to find the treasures,<br></li><li>Trade with hawkers, unlock and upgrade items,<br></li><li>Use everything you have to identify what is chasing you,<br></li><li>Run away from them or exploit their weakness to avoid them,<br></li><li>Open more coffins to find the exit.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/e2f23611e7b64c0507877cb534ebb8ca.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/a90a6bb6120aea8c5163dd1e9fa8c2ec.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Hellventure is a brand-new first-person escape horror game that combines rogue-lite elements.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/37ae2ef3d2878bcab203c6384bb42f8d.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div><br>You are in a computer-generated dark dungeon.<br>Open the coffin in the room, you may get the treasures, you may find the exit, and you may release scary monsters.<br><br>Will you be trapped forever, or escape from here?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/d713cc33e156257bacd9a4b84b6f8072.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open the coffins to find the treasures,<br></li><li>Trade with hawkers, unlock and upgrade items,<br></li><li>Use everything you have to identify what is chasing you,<br></li><li>Run away from them or exploit their weakness to avoid them,<br></li><li>Open more coffins to find the exit.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/e2f23611e7b64c0507877cb534ebb8ca.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164400/extras/a90a6bb6120aea8c5163dd1e9fa8c2ec.avif?t=1670993728\" /></div>",
